{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/lumena-omniyat-business-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1197,"crm_id":"5469","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Lumena","slug":"lumena-omniyat-business-bay","display_address":"Business Bay","building_type":["offices"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Omniyat","price":19000000,"display_price":"19M","lattitude":25.190443266769,"longitude":55.260706071438,"min_bedrooms":0,"max_bedrooms":0,"display_bedrooms":"Offices","about":"<p>Rising at the gateway of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/business-bay/\">Business Bay</a>, Lumena by Omniyat redefines Dubai’s commercial skyline with its commanding 49-storey presence. This iconic commercial tower delivers more than just office space—it offers a meticulously designed business ecosystem tailored for decision-makers and visionaries. Lumena stands as a symbol of elevated ambition, offering full-floor and half-floor office configurations designed with precision, functionality, and panoramic views of Burj Khalifa and the Arabian Gulf. Its prime location ensures seamless connectivity across the city, with immediate access to the Business Bay Metro Station and major commercial arteries, placing every business landmark within reach.</p><p>Crafted by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-omniyat/\">Omniyat</a>, a developer renowned for architectural innovation and luxury, Lumena combines landmark design with elite amenities. The tower’s offering extends far beyond its offices, featuring Dubai’s first Sky Theatre, an exclusive Executive Business Club, high-performance wellness suites, and curated retail and dining experiences at its lifestyle podium. With sustainability at the forefront—targeting LEED, WiredScore, and SmartScore Platinum certifications—Lumena Business Bay Dubai emerges as a premium destination for enterprises seeking both prestige and performance in the heart of the UAE’s commercial capital.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Lumena_by_Omniyat_Premium_Offices_in_Business_Bay_d2ce4cb1dc.jpg","hash":"Lumena_by_Omniyat_Premium_Offices_in_Business_Bay_d2ce4cb1dc","name":"Lumena by Omniyat – Premium Offices in Business Bay"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Lumena_by_Omniyat_Premium_Offices_in_Business_Bay_c2112854af.jpg","hash":"Lumena_by_Omniyat_Premium_Offices_in_Business_Bay_c2112854af","name":"Lumena by Omniyat – Premium Offices in Business Bay"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Lumena_by_Omniyat_Premium_Offices_in_Business_Bay_25b0f99af1.jpg","hash":"Lumena_by_Omniyat_Premium_Offices_in_Business_Bay_25b0f99af1","name":"Lumena by Omniyat – Premium Offices in Business Bay"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Lumena_by_Omniyat_Premium_Offices_in_Business_Bay_8ab1755ceb.jpg","hash":"Lumena_by_Omniyat_Premium_Offices_in_Business_Bay_8ab1755ceb","name":"Lumena by Omniyat – Premium Offices in Business Bay"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Lumena_by_Omniyat_Premium_Offices_in_Business_Bay_1a0a72c83f.jpg","hash":"Lumena_by_Omniyat_Premium_Offices_in_Business_Bay_1a0a72c83f","name":"Lumena by Omniyat – Premium Offices in Business Bay"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Lumena_by_Omniyat_Premium_Offices_in_Business_Bay_d3af953fad.jpg","hash":"Lumena_by_Omniyat_Premium_Offices_in_Business_Bay_d3af953fad","name":"Lumena by Omniyat – Premium Offices in Business Bay"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Lumena_by_Omniyat_Premium_Offices_in_Business_Bay_92fb3e6d0b.jpg","hash":"Lumena